# Example: one Time, two subscribers (World and Scene)

## Schema

```
World = $Time Scene
Scene = $Time
Time = Int/t
```

## Construction

```
t = [:Time 0].
[:World t [:Scene t]]
```

## Methods

```
Time::update = { [:Time t] }
World::update = { [:World time scene] }
Scene::update = { [:Scene time] }
```

## Target

```
%terminal

%main
public static function main():Void {
    var assemblage = WorldAssemblage.factory();
    var helper = new WCHNTHelper();
    trace(assemblage.toConstruction(0, helper));
    assemblage.time.update();
    trace(assemblage.toConstruction(0, helper));
}
```
